Usage of redrive-delivery-mysql:
  -actor string
    	operator identity attested by this privileged caller
  -address string
    	MySQL host:port
  -apply
    	apply audited redrive; inspect first with inspect-deliveries-mysql
  -ca string
    	optional PEM CA file; defaults to system trust
  -database string
    	shared logical application database
  -isolated-fixture
    	plaintext only for explicitly enabled mysql:3306 disposable fixture
  -job string
    	pending job UUID
  -max-attempts int
    	explicit NEW delivery attempt budget; domain attempts are preserved
  -password-env string
    	password environment variable (default "DATA_MODEL_MYSQL_REDRIVE_PASSWORD")
  -queue string
    	source queue; cross-queue redrive is forbidden
  -reason string
    	required recovery reason, at most 2048 bytes
  -request string
    	stable request UUID; reuse all inputs after uncertain commit
  -scheduled-at string
    	explicit RFC3339 availability time, microsecond precision
  -server-name string
    	TLS server name; defaults to address hostname
  -source string
    	discarded delivery UUID
  -tenant string
    	explicit authorized tenant UUID
  -timeout duration
    	overall deadline (default 30s)
  -user string
    	authorized operator account
